    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d744">

                <pb facs="0835" n="750" xml:id="pg750"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">860c.4016/56a: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Minister in
                        Poland</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Gibson</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-05-28T18:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">May 28, 1919, 6
                                p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>17. Department’s No. 9 May 21, No. 12 May 23, and No. 14 May 24.<anchor n="7"
                        xml:id="d744-f1"/> American newspapers are publishing long articles giving
                    dates and places where Jews are reported to have been massacred or otherwise
                    mistreated. Congressman Siegel has personally furnished Department with another
                    such list. Agitation this matter continues and Department must know whole truth
                    situation at once. You are requested to give investigation treatment Jews by
                    Poles and attitude Jews towards Poles precedence over other matters in order to
                    furnish Department complete report without delay.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Polk</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
